sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer as 买家
    participant UI as Vue 前端
    participant Voucher as VoucherController
    participant Order as OrderController
    participant Service as VoucherService / OrderServiceImpl
    participant DB as MySQL

    Buyer->>UI: 点击立即领取
    UI->>Voucher: POST /api/voucher/{id}/claim
    Voucher->>Service: 校验领取期、状态和余量
    Service->>DB: INSERT user_voucher
    DB-->>UI: 待使用

    Buyer->>UI: 选择优惠券并提交订单
    UI->>Order: POST /api/order/create
    Order->>Service: 校验店铺小计和金额门槛
    Service->>DB: 保存订单金额并占用用户券
    DB-->>UI: 待付款订单

    Buyer->>UI: 确认支付
    UI->>Order: POST /api/order/{id}/pay
    Order->>Service: 更新订单并核销用户券
    Service->>DB: user_voucher.status=2
    DB-->>UI: 待发货 / 已使用
